      "body": "# Globe Telecom\r\n\r\n> Globe Telecom is one of the Philippines' leading telecommunications providers, offering postpaid and prepaid mobile plans, home broadband, 5G, and digital lifestyle services.\r\n\r\n- [Go Forward Together - Globe Telecom](https://www.globe.com.ph): Power your day with broadband and mobile offers designed to keep you connected, creative, and confident.\r\n\r\n## Products\r\n\r\nExplore Globe's consumer and business connectivity services, including mobile plans, home internet, 5G, and enterprise solutions.\r\n\r\n- [Globe Postpaid](https://www.globe.com.ph/postpaid): Apply for Globe Postpaid mobile plans, including SIM-only options, smartphone device bundles, data and call inclusions, plan pricing, and Platinum GPlans for premium subscribers.\r\n- [Globe Prepaid](https://www.globe.com.ph/prepaid): Take your Globe Prepaid experience to the next level with prepaid SIM cards, mobile data promos, call and text offers, load packages, 5G services, and devices made just for you.\r\n- [Globe AT HOME](https://www.globe.com.ph/broadband): Power your household with high-speed fiber internet using Globe AT HOME GFiber plans, featuring reliable GFiber plans optimized for household streaming, gaming, and remote work.\r\n- [GFiber Prepaid](https://www.globe.com.ph/broadband/gfiber-prepaid): Experience affordable and reliable reloadable prepaid fiber internet, perfect for budget-conscious Filipinos looking for high-speed connectivity.\r\n- [Globe Business](https://www.globe.com.ph/business): Find out about the main Globe Business gateway for enterprise connectivity, network infrastructure, cloud services, hardware solutions, and digital transformation.\r\n\r\n## Promo\r\n\r\nBrowse Globe's mobile, broadband, roaming, and personalized offers for data, calls, texts, home internet, and travel.\r\n\r\n- [GPlan Jr.](https://www.globe.com.ph/postpaid/gplan-jr-499): Keep your kids connected with GPlan Jr., Globe Postpaid’s kid-friendly add-on that includes 10 GB of data, unlimited calls and texts, and access to essential apps for learning, communication, and everyday use, all for ₱499 per month.\r\n- [UnliGo Promos](https://www.globe.com.ph/prepaid/promos/unligo): Enjoy unlimited access to Facebook, TikTok, or Instagram with UnliGo promos, plus 8 GB for all other sites and apps, so you can stay connected, scroll, share, and browse beyond your favorite social platforms. \r\n- [GoRoam Promos](https://www.globe.com.ph/international/roaming): Be roam-ready and stay connected wherever you travel with Globe's international data, call, and text packages for both postpaid and prepaid users.\r\n- [Globe Fiber-to-the-Room (FTTR)](https://www.globe.com.ph/broadband/fiber-to-the-room): Upgrade to next-gen home WiFi solution with dedicated fiber connectivity in every room for faster speeds, stronger coverage, lower latency, and uninterrupted streaming, gaming, video calls, and browsing.\r\n- [All-New GPlan PLUS](https://www.globe.com.ph/postpaid/all-new-gplan-plus): Explore Globe's All-New GPlan PLUS, a customizable postpaid plan with generous data, flexible plan options, exclusive lifestyle perks, and device bundles designed to match your needs and budget.\r\n\r\n## Apps\r\n\r\nDiscover Globe apps and digital entertainment partners that help you manage your account, make payments, and enjoy your favorite streaming and music services.\r\n\r\n- [GlobeOne App](https://www.globe.com.ph/apps/globeone): GlobeOne app is your all-in-one digital companion to track data and load balances, pay mobile or broadband bills securely, and redeem exclusive promos instantly.\r\n- [GCash on Globe](https://www.globe.com.ph/apps/gcash): Connect your Globe account with GCash to reload, pay your mobile or broadband bills, and enjoy fast, convenient digital payments.\r\n- [Disney+ with Globe](https://www.globe.com.ph/apps/disneyplus): Get Disney+ through Globe with eligible plans and bundles, plus step-by-step guides for subscription, activation, and account management.\r\n- [Netflix Bundle](https://www.globe.com.ph/apps/netflix): Subscribe to Netflix with select Globe Postpaid and GFiber plans, and learn about available bundles, pricing, and activation.\r\n- [Spotify Bundle](https://www.globe.com.ph/apps/spotify): Enjoy Spotify Premium through eligible Globe plans and discover available bundles, subscription options, and activation guides.\r\n\r\n## Blogs\r\n\r\nExplore Globe's guides, tips, and stories to help you get the most out of your mobile, broadband, and digital lifestyle.\r\n\r\n- [Globe Student Program - Sailing into the Horizon](https://www.globe.com.ph/blog/sailing-into-the-horizon-internship-journey): Discover Globe’s dedicated student program and internship journey, designed to empower the next generation of leaders with real-world experience, mentorship, and professional growth.\r\n- [Globe Hotline Alternatives: How to Talk to Globe Customer Service ASAP](https://www.globe.com.ph/blog/globe-hotline-alternatives): Discover the fastest ways to get help from Globe through the GlobeOne app, Messenger, Viber, digital assistants, official support channels, and customer service resources. \r\n- [Rewards Guide](https://www.globe.com.ph/blog/ultimate-guide-globe-rewards): Learn how Globe Rewards works, from earning and redeeming points to enjoying exclusive perks, vouchers, and partner offers.\r\n- [eSIM Guide](https://www.globe.com.ph/what-is-esim): Understand what an eSIM is, how it works, its benefits, and how to activate an eSIM on your compatible device.\r\n- [Alex Eala: Inspiring the Next Generation of Filipino Champions](https://www.globe.com.ph/blog/alex-eala) - Follow Alex Eala's inspiring journey, career milestones, and achievements as one of the Philippines' brightest tennis stars.\r\n\r\n## FAQs\r\n\r\nFind answers to common questions, troubleshoot your Globe services, and access official support resources for your mobile, broadband, and business accounts.\r\n\r\n- [Globe Starlink Mobile FAQs](https://www.globe.com.ph/help/starlink-satellite-to-mobile-service): Learn how you can stay connected without a traditional cellular signal, send texts, and use data on your phone using the Globe Starlink satellite-to-mobile service.\r\n- [Troubleshooting](https://www.globe.com.ph/help/troubleshooting): Follow step-by-step troubleshooting guides to resolve common issues with your mobile, broadband, WiFi, and Globe services.\r\n- [SIM Registration Act FAQs](https://www.globe.com.ph/help/sim-registration-act): Find answers to common questions about SIM registration, including eligibility, valid IDs, account verification, and regulatory requirements.\r\n- [Network FAQs](https://www.globe.com.ph/help/network/faq): Learn more about Globe's mobile network, coverage, connectivity, data services, and frequently asked network-related questions.\r\n- [Globe Business Support](https://www.globe.com.ph/help/business/faqs): Access resources and support for Globe Business products, enterprise connectivity, managed services, and digital solutions.",
      "url": "https://www.globe.com.ph/llms.txt"
    },
